Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: plymouth-theme-debian-slider
Architecture: all
Depends: plymouth, plymouth-label, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Plymouth boot splash theme with a sliding progress bar
 A minimal Plymouth theme: the Debian swirl above a thin bar with a glowing
 highlight that slides back and forth while the system boots and fills the
 bar when the boot completes. Includes a password dialog for encrypted disks.
 The splash is scaled to the screen so it looks the same at every resolution.
 .
 Select it with: plymouth-set-default-theme -R debian-slider
